"旧版本留下的位置记录尚待恢复。这里的目录授权仅用于完成这次恢复；日常托盘显示使用上方的菜单栏设置文件。" = "Position records left by an older version still need recovery. This folder authorization is only for that recovery; everyday tray display uses the menu bar settings file above.";
"辅助功能授权不包含排序目录。点击下方按钮，在系统选择窗口中确认目录；仍可使用 ⌘ 拖拽分组。" = "Accessibility authorization does not include the ordering folder. Use the button below and confirm the folder in the system picker. ⌘ dragging remains available.";
"后台分组需要读取和更新系统菜单栏排序记录。请通过系统目录选择窗口，仅授权菜单栏的 Preferences 目录；辅助功能权限不会自动提供这项访问。" = "Background grouping reads and updates system menu bar ordering records. Use the system folder picker to authorize only the menu bar Preferences folder. Accessibility does not grant this access automatically.";
"恢复时保留其他操作对菜单栏所做的修改。完成后，这项旧版目录权限不再是日常托盘使用的前提。" = "Recovery preserves menu bar changes made by other actions. Afterward, this legacy folder permission is no longer required for everyday tray use.";
"只访问菜单栏排序目录，不需要「完整磁盘访问权限」。目录可访问后，仍需逐项确认身份和实际位置，才能保存为已应用。" = "Only the menu bar ordering folder is accessed; Full Disk Access is not required. After access is available, each identity and actual position must still be confirmed before saving as applied.";
"重新选择排序目录…" = "Choose Ordering Folder Again…";
"授权排序目录…" = "Authorize Ordering Folder…";
"打开系统目录选择窗口，由你确认仅访问菜单栏排序目录。" = "Open the system folder picker and confirm access to only the menu bar ordering folder.";
"重新检测目录访问" = "Recheck Folder Access";
"不开启也能使用托盘，优先显示应用身份图标；应用图标不可用时显示名称。开启后可在应用图标不可用时使用原始菜单栏图标回退；这项权限不会增加应用操作的兼容性。" = "The tray works without this permission and prefers the app identity icon, falling back to a name. When enabled, an original menu bar image can be used if the app icon is unavailable. This permission does not improve app-action compatibility.";
"只采集已确认的图标窗口或小块区域，不上传、不保存到磁盘，也不采集声音。原始图标是最近的快照，隐藏期间可能不会及时反映状态变化。" = "Only confirmed icon windows or small regions are captured. Nothing is uploaded, saved to disk, or recorded as audio. Original icons are recent snapshots and may not reflect changes while hidden.";
"申请权限" = "Request Permission";
"点击下方按钮，按 macOS 提示操作。" = "Click the button below and follow the macOS prompt.";
"开启当前应用" = "Enable the Current App";
"在系统设置的屏幕录制或屏幕与系统音频录制页面开启 Menu Tidy。" = "Enable Menu Tidy under Screen Recording or Screen & System Audio Recording in System Settings.";
"返回并检测" = "Return and Check";
"完成系统确认后返回，点击「重新检测」。" = "After confirming in the system, return and click Check Again.";
"系统授权需要你亲自确认。即使系统页面名称包含音频，Menu Tidy 也不采集声音。" = "You must confirm system authorization yourself. Menu Tidy does not capture audio even if the system page name includes audio.";
"申请屏幕录制权限" = "Request Screen Recording Permission";
"打开屏幕录制权限设置，选择当前安装的 Menu Tidy。" = "Open Screen Recording settings and select the currently installed Menu Tidy.";
"若 macOS 提示需要重新启动应用，请先退出 Menu Tidy，再从当前安装位置重新打开；已保存的设置会保留。授权尚未生效时，托盘仍可显示应用身份图标。" = "If macOS asks you to restart the app, quit Menu Tidy and reopen it from its current location. Saved settings are kept. Until authorization takes effect, the tray can still show app identity icons.";
"退出 Menu Tidy" = "Quit Menu Tidy";
"退出后请从应用程序文件夹重新打开 Menu Tidy。" = "After quitting, reopen Menu Tidy from the Applications folder.";
"仅影响「收起后隐藏」分组，默认关闭。" = "Affects only the Tray group. Off by default.";
