"完成一次托盘设置后可启用。" = "Available after the tray setup is completed once.";
"启动约 30 秒后刷新图标并应用一次，未完成的选择继续保留。" = "About 30 seconds after launch, refresh icons and apply once. Unfinished choices remain.";
