"登录 Mac 后自动开启 Menu Tidy。" = "Open Menu Tidy automatically when you log in to your Mac.";
"图标栏画面只在内存中显示，不上传、不存盘、不采集声音" = "Menu bar images stay in memory: not uploaded, saved, or recorded as audio";
"点击菜单栏箭头打开独立托盘，右键打开设置。没有原始图像时显示应用身份图标；原生菜单栏的可见容量仍受屏幕宽度限制。" = "Click the menu bar arrow to open the tray, or right-click for settings. App identity icons appear when no original image is available. Native menu bar capacity is still limited by screen width.";
"自动检查更新" = "Check for updates automatically";
"默认每 30 分钟检查当前更新通道。菜单栏操作进行中会顺延；关闭后仍可手动检查。" = "Checks the current update channel every 30 minutes by default. Checks wait while menu bar work is active; manual checks remain available when this is off.";
